eet appearance and always has a gentle smile, she is a bit forceful, but it will not make people uncomfortable.\nH (black hair): Age 35. He's the sexy and elegant type, thin and somewhat feminine in appearance, sometimes a little tsundere.\nY and H are good roommates with a body relationship, but not to the extent of lovers. The two are almost the same height.\n\nPicture content:\nH came back from training, wearing a training suit that exposed his waist, Y poked his waist when H was drinking water, and Y poked his waist again when H was tidying up, H reluctantly told Y she can touch his waist at will, Y happily touched H's waist everywhere.\n\nIf you need to use text, please use Japanese! You can change the details at will. If the fee is not enough,  you can return the request for me to modify it. Thank you so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ReKdS57wKd5QPE_ctOE3U4pBzAlZf22Y?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@0komekueba/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2608734, "client_id": 13464, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e7b20948/uploads/origins/1db1d4dc-a6d0-4ea8-b6da-f766136914c8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e1baa356b6b87de54efb6cc7c1dce70", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e7b20948/uploads/origins/1db1d4dc-a6d0-4ea8-b6da-f766136914c8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e1baa356b6b87de54efb6cc7c1dce70, https://si.imgix.net/e7b20948/uploads/origins/1db1d4dc-a6d0-4ea8-b6da-f766136914c8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1797217cc118aea40cbf643d7067377c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e7b20948/uploads/origins/1db1d4dc-a6d0-4ea8-b6da-f766136914c8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7da5afe5df41609af1968a